{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39869","headline":"回文诗二首 二 · 徐夤","name":"回文诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻帆数点千峰碧，水接云山四望遥。\n晴日海霞红霭霭，晓天江树绿迢迢。\n清波石眼泉当槛，小迳松门寺对桥。\n明月钓舟渔浦远，倾山雪浪暗随潮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39869.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39869","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}